<title>UK: CRICKET-GLAMORGAN 30-0 V AUSTRALIA (369-4 DEC) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-GLAMORGAN 30-0 V AUSTRALIA (369-4 DEC) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glamorgan, replying to Australia's first innings score of 369 for four declared, were 30 without loss at the close on the opening day of the three-day tour match on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
